on-invertible and the image of the rectangle under the action of $T$ is a line segment." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186285204 #edb/ref 1080 "-4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186285204 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186285204 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2e8bb8d9-a3bb-5f41-8ede-1ac64d1b2be4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186285298 #edb/ref 1080 "$C$ only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186285298 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186285298 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "36a60e37-2471-5aa2-b57a-1481a0f6284d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186285337 #edb/ref 1080 "22" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186285337 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186285337 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3a58f260-85bb-5900-91d0-ca3e5d9f962c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186285760 #edb/ref 1080 ">" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186285760 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186285760 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "6a6267bb-2818-55e7-87ad-c6c4d297e820" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186286127 #edb/ref 1080 "20" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186286127 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186286127 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9368e5b0-1f0a-5663-846f-83ac974a77bd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186286141 #edb/ref 1080 "$B$ only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186286141 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186286141 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "94ce2f0a-5b1b-5d86-8907-3894fa6c197b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186286309 #edb/ref 1080 "$A$ and $C$ only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186286309 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186286309 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a6a848df-7548-5571-afb1-68281340115c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186286489 #edb/ref 1080 "$A$ only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186286489 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186286489 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "bafe69